#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Magaca aad jeclaan lahayd inaad siiso UPS-kan.  Aaladaha APCUPSD iyo NUT, waxaa si otomaatig ah loogu abuuri doonaa Aalad Cacti ah oo u dhiganta UPS-ka iyadoo la adeegsanayo magacan.  UPS-yada ku salaysan SNMP, waa inaad marka hore abuurtaa Aaladda Cacti."

#: upses.php
msgid "New UPS"
msgstr "UPS Cusub"

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Description"
msgstr "Sharaxaadda UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "A more detailed Description of this UPS if required."
msgstr "Sharaxaad faahfaahsan oo ku saabsan UPS-kan haddii loo baahdo."

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Type"
msgstr "Nooca UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Type of UPS you are monitoring."
msgstr "Nooca UPS ee aad la socoto."

#: upses.php
msgid "Poller ID"
msgstr "Aqoonsiga Poller-ka"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller that this UPS exists in is monitored by"
msgstr "Poller-ka uu UPS-kani ku jiro ee lagala socdo"

#: upses.php
msgid "Site Name"
msgstr "Magaca Goobta"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "Goobta uu UPS-kani ku yaal."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Waxba"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Meesha"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Meesha jireed ee ay Aaladdu ku taal.  Qoraalkan xor ah wuxuu noqon karaa qol, meesha rack-ga, iwm."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Aaladda Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "UPS-yada ku salaysan SNMP, dooro Aaladda Cacti si loogu isticmaalo aqoonsiga SNMP.  Haddii kale, dooro Waxba, oo plugin-ka UPS ayaa si otomaatig ah kuugu abuuri doona Aaladda."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Si otomaatig ah u abuur marka ugu horreysa ee Poll"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Hawl-gal ah"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Calaamadee si aad isla markiiba u bilowdo ururinta xogta."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Macluumaadka APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Hostname-ka martigeliyaha uu ku shaqaynayo apcupsd ama server-ka NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Port-ka TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Geli Port-ka TCP ee UPS-kan.  apcupsd wuxuu caadiyan adeegsadaa 3551, NUT-na wuxuu caadiyan adeegsadaa 3493."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Waqtiga dhammaadka (ilbiriqsi)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Inta uu poller-ku sugayo apcupsd ama server-ka NUT ka hor inta uusan ka quusan UPS-kan, laga bilaabo 1 ilaa 120 ilbiriqsi.  UPS-yada ku salaysan SNMP waxay beddelkeeda adeegsadaan waqtiga dhammaadka SNMP."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Magaca NUT UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Magaca UPS-ka ee ku yaal server-ka NUT, sida uu u qoray \"upsc -l\" (qaybta ka horreysa @ ee ups@host).  Hal server oo NUT ah wuxuu u adeegi karaa dhowr UPS."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Magaca Isticmaalaha NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaari.  Akoonka upsd.users ee lagu xaqiijinayo.  Bannaan u daa si loo helo gelitaan akhris-kaliya oo aan magac lahayn, taas oo ah sida server-rada NUT badanaa loola socdo."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Erayga Sirta ah ee NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Erayga sirta ah ee Magaca Isticmaalaha NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Isticmaal TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Ku sir xiriirka STARTTLS ka hor inta aan la dirin wax aqoonsi ah.  Shahaadada server-ka NUT iyo magaca martigeliyaha waa la xaqiijiyaa, markaa shahaadada waa inuu ku kalsoon yahay poller-ka Cacti, ama waxaad u tilmaami kartaa faylkeeda CA / shahaadada hoose."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Faylka CA / Shahaadada"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaari.  Dariiqada buuxda ee ku taal poller-ka Cacti oo aadda faylka PEM ee haya shahaadada CA (ama shahaadada server-ka ee is-saxiixday) si loogu xaqiijiyo server-ka NUT, tusaale ahaan /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  Magaca martigeliyaha ee sare waa inuu la mid noqdaa shahaadada."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Oggolow Shahaadada Is-saxiixday"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Aqbal shahaado kasta adigoon hubin.  Xiriirku weli waa la siray, laakiin server-ka NUT lama xaqiijin, markaa qof dhexda ku jira wuxuu akhrin karaa aqoonsiga NUT.  Doorbido Faylka CA / Shahaadada ee sare."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Hostname-ka meesha uu ku yaal wakiilka snmp."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "Aqoonsiga Poller-ka lama beddeli karo inta UPS-ku ku xiran yahay Aaladda Cacti.  Beddel poller-ka ku yaal aaladda beddelkeeda."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Qaabka UPS lama helin! Lama nuqul karin."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Midna ka mid ah UPS-yada la doortay weli ma laha Aalad Cacti, markaa Otomaatigga Shaxda lama orodsiin.  Aalad waxaa la abuuraa marka ugu horreysa ee poll guuleysto."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es).  %d UPS(es) have no Cacti Device yet and were skipped."
msgstr "Otomaatigga Shaxda waxaa loo orodsiiyay %d UPS.  %d UPS weli ma laha Aalad Cacti waana laga booday."

