msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to run Graph Automation for the following UPSes.  Graphs, data sources and tree items are created from each device's templates and the matching automation rules; graphs that already exist are left as they are.  Only a UPS that already has a Cacti Device is affected."
msgstr[0] "Guji 'Sii wad' si aad u socodsiiso Otomaatigga Jaantusyada ee UPS-ka soo socda. Jaantusyada, ilaha xogta iyo walxaha geedka waxaa laga abuuraa qaababka qalabka iyo xeerarka otomaatigga ee u dhigma; jaantusyada hore u jiray sidooda ayaa loo daayaa. Keliya UPS hore u leh Qalabka Cacti ayaa la saameeyaa."
msgstr[1] "Guji 'Sii wad' si aad u socodsiiso Otomaatigga Jaantusyada ee UPS-yada soo socda. Jaantusyada, ilaha xogta iyo walxaha geedka waxaa laga abuuraa qaababka qalab kasta iyo xeerarka otomaatigga ee u dhigma; jaantusyada hore u jiray sidooda ayaa loo daayaa. Keliya UPS hore u leh Qalabka Cacti ayaa la saameeyaa."

